(d) THE BOUNDARY r_M = sqrt(G M_b/a0)  ->  the REGIME-SWITCH POINT of the
    acceleration distribution: g_N(r_M) = a0 EXACTLY, and in the kernel's
    variable u = g_obs/2a0 the boundary is u(r_M) = 1/2 -- the MODE of the
